"maritime zones of India" means the territorial waters of India or the exclusive economic zone of India;
(h)
"master", in relation to a vessel, means the person for the time being having command or charge of the vessel;
(i)
"owner", in relation to a vessel, includes any association of persons, whether incorporated or not, by whom the vessel is
owned or chartered;
